{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t中共中央辦公廳、國務院辦公廳近日印發《文化遺產保護傳承「十五五」規劃》，是首次在文化遺產保護領域制定五年規劃。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n中央精神文明建設辦公室表示，將建立全國文化遺產資源總目錄，制定文化遺產保護法，強化文化遺產的法制保障。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：朱錫君\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:03.485338+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:33:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T21:58:04.228881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:46.523751+00:00","content_hash":"4e24c0ac9609322188b5fb3a033bb23c4c2d253b311e30eead80bfe227ee1514","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}